
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="description" content="Discover and download free test games from MTS Games.">
  <title>MTS Games | Play Beyond Limits</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: #080b12;
      color: #f5f7ff;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }
    header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 22px 8%;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #202638;
    }
    .logo { font-size: 23px; font-weight: bold; }
    .logo span { color: #7c5cff; }
    nav a { color: #c7cce0; text-decoration: none; margin-left: 20px; }
    .hero {
      padding: 90px 8%;
      text-align: center;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at top, #252052, #080b12 70%);
    }
    .tag {
      color: #b8aaff;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(38px, 7vw, 68px); margin: 20px 0; }
    h1 span { color: #9b83ff; }
    .hero p { color: #b5bdd0; line-height: 1.8; max-width: 620px; margin: auto; }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 22px;
      margin: 24px 6px 0;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
      background: #7858ff;
      color: white;
    }
    .secondary { background: #171c2b; border: 1px solid #343b52; }
    main { max-width: 1000px; margin: auto; padding: 45px 22px; }
    .game {
      background: #111625;
      border: 1px solid #252d42;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 28px;
    }
    .game h2 { margin-top: 0; }
    .muted { color: #aab3c8; line-height: 1.8; }
    .status {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #1c3040;
      color: #80d8ff;
      padding: 7px 11px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    footer { text-align: center; padding: 28px; color: #8790a7; border-top: 1px solid #202638; }
    a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid white; outline-offset: 4px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="logo">MTS <span>GAMES</span></div>
    <nav><a href="#games">Games</a><a href="#about">About</a></nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="tag">WELCOME TO OUR WORLD</div>
    <h1>PLAY BEYOND <span>LIMITS.</span></h1>
    <p>Discover our games, explore new worlds, and join us on the journey. Play our early test builds and help us improve!</p>
    <a class="button" href="#games">EXPLORE GAMES ↓</a>
  </section>

  <main>
    <section id="games" class="game">
      <span class="status">IN DEVELOPMENT</span>
      <h2>My First Game</h2>
      <p class="muted">Welcome to our first test build! More details, screenshots, and updates will appear here as development continues.</p>
      <p class="muted">Windows PC · Android</p>
      <a class="button" href="#downloads">DOWNLOAD OPTIONS ↓</a>
      <div id="downloads">
        <h3>Download the test build</h3>
        <p class="muted">Downloads will be available here once the game files are uploaded.</p>
        <p><a class="button secondary" href="#downloads">Windows — Coming Soon</a></p>
        <p><a class="button secondary" href="#downloads">Android — Coming Soon</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" style="padding:40px 5px">
      <h2>About MTS Games</h2>
      <p class="muted">An independent game development project focused on building exciting worlds and sharing the journey with players.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>© 2026 MTS Games · Made with passion for gaming.</footer>
</body>
</html>
